---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';

---
<figure class="fig11">
  <div class="scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 290" role="img" aria-label="Two lanes. The event loop lane holds four grey blocks of 65 milliseconds, one per score request, back to back. In the lane below, a health request arrives at 5 milliseconds and the red bar shows it waiting until all four blocks are done before it is answered in 1 millisecond.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>A blocking call in async def: every other request waits its turn</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lời gọi chặn trong async def: mọi request khác phải xếp hàng</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="server" x={40} y={96} size={24} />
    <text x="70" y="90" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>event loop</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>event loop</tspan></text>
    <text x="70" y="108" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>one thread</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>một thread</tspan></text>
    <rect x="200" y="76" width="121" height="40" class="bar" />
    <text x="261" y="101" class="t inv" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>score 65 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>score 65 ms</tspan></text>
    <rect x="324" y="76" width="121" height="40" class="bar" />
    <text x="385" y="101" class="t inv" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>score 65 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>score 65 ms</tspan></text>
    <rect x="447" y="76" width="121" height="40" class="bar" />
    <text x="508" y="101" class="t inv" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>score 65 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>score 65 ms</tspan></text>
    <rect x="570" y="76" width="121" height="40" class="bar" />
    <text x="631" y="101" class="t inv" text-anchor="middle"><tspan data-lang-en>score 65 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>score 65 ms</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="hourglass" x={40} y={190} size={24} />
    <text x="70" y="184" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>GET /health</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>GET /health</tspan></text>
    <text x="70" y="202" class="m"><tspan data-lang-en>arrives at 5 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đến lúc 5 ms</tspan></text>
    <rect x="210" y="172" width="484" height="30" class="rbox" />
    <rect x="694" y="172" width="4" height="30" class="rbar" />
    <text x="222" y="192" class="r"><tspan data-lang-en>waits for all four scores, then takes 1 ms</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chờ cả bốn lần score, rồi mới mất 1 ms</tspan></text>
    <line x1="210" y1="118" x2="210" y2="170" class="lead" />
    <text x="40" y="262" class="t"><tspan data-lang-en>Captured: /health alone p99 = 2 ms. While four /score calls were in flight it was p50 = 1 ms but p99 = 278 ms.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Capture: /health chạy một mình p99 = 2 ms. Khi có bốn lời gọi /score cùng lúc: p50 vẫn 1 ms nhưng p99 = 278 ms.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The loop has one thread. Code that never awaits keeps it, so a cheap route queues behind an expensive one.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Loop chỉ có một thread. Code không bao giờ await sẽ giữ nó, nên route rẻ phải xếp sau route đắt.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .fig11 { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .fig11 .scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .fig11 svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .fig11 text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .fig11 .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .fig11 .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .fig11 .m { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 13px; }
  .fig11 .r { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .fig11 .bar { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .fig11 .rbar { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .lead { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .fig11 .rline { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .fig11 .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .fig11 .rbox { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .fig11 .arrow { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .fig11 .arrow-l { stroke: var(--text-faint); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 .rarrow { fill: var(--red); }
  .fig11 .rarrow-l { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .fig11 figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .fig11 .t.inv { fill: var(--bg); font-weight: 700; }
</style>
